+The Company uses Cloudflare, Inc.'s Turnstile on the Contact Us page to perform security verification and prevent automated malicious requests. Cloudflare may process information including the IP address, browser and connection information (such as the User-Agent and TLS fingerprint), sitekey and associated origin. Cloudflare states that it processes this information to provide bot detection and blocking for the Company's website and to improve Turnstile's bot detection capabilities. For details, see the [Cloudflare Turnstile Privacy Addendum](https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/).
