+The personal information of the information subject is managed using a cloud service with a server based in the United States. However, no other tasks other than the storage of information for customer management and security verification of the Contact Us inquiry form are entrusted, and the company is responsible for preventing information leaks and managing access rights.
+
+When the inquiry page loads and security verification takes place, information such as the IP address, browser User-Agent, TLS fingerprint, sitekey and associated origin may be transmitted over the network to and processed by Cloudflare. Turnstile does not access, store, or transmit form entries or other page inputs.
+
+**Contact Us Security Verification (Cloudflare Turnstile)**
+
+- Recipient: Cloudflare, Inc. (privacy contact: dpo@cloudflare.com)
+- Items transferred: IP address, browser User-Agent, TLS fingerprint, sitekey and associated origin
+- Countries of transfer: United States and Europe (data center locations stated by Cloudflare)
+- Time and method of transfer: over the network when the inquiry page is loaded and security verification is performed
+- Purpose of transfer: detection and blocking of automated malicious requests and security verification of the inquiry form
+- Retention period: the period necessary to fulfill the purposes of processing. The information is deleted or returned at the Company's request when the agreement between the Company and Cloudflare ends or the purpose of processing is achieved.
+- Role of Cloudflare: a processor providing website security services on behalf of the Company, and a controller processing the information for its own purpose of improving Turnstile's bot detection capabilities.
+
+The method and effect of refusing the transfer are set out in paragraph 7 of this Article.
